.DS_Store

# Python bytecode cache from scripts/ tooling (e.g. asset re-export helpers).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Designer working files + asset backups — the engine never reads assets/_source/.
# Keeps the ~300 MB of oversized originals (backed up by scripts/optimize-assets.mjs)
# local-only so they don't bloat the repo. 54 legacy _source files are already
# tracked from earlier; run `git rm -r --cached assets/_source` to slim those too.
assets/_source/

# Generated docs — written by scripts/{audit-assets,audit-images,generate-asset-
# contact-sheets,generate-semantic-registry,validate-composition,capture-composition-
# pass}.mjs. No script READS them; they regenerate on demand. Kept out of git so the
# committed docs are only the hand-authored living set (brief, dev-guide, road-kit,
# style-audit, CHANGELOG, visual-qa). Re-run the matching script to refresh locally.
docs/asset-audit-report.md
docs/asset-semantic-action-list.md
docs/asset-missing-art-list.md
docs/asset-semantic-registry.md
docs/asset-production-manifest.md
docs/asset-cleanup-proposal.md
docs/asset-duplicate-cleanup-proposal.md
